  (7, 'Web Browsing & Internet', 'medium', 'What is the real difference between Google Chrome and Google Search?', 'There is zero difference', 'Chrome is a search website; Google is a laptop brand', 'Chrome is the Browser app installed on your device; Google Search is a website used inside a browser to look up info', 'Both are hardware parts', 'c'),
