  (8, 'Application Software & OS', 'easy', 'What are the three small buttons ( — , □ , ✕ ) at the top-right corner of almost every Windows app window for?', 'Mute, Play, and Pause music', 'Minimize, Maximize, and Close the window', 'Copy, Cut, and Paste text', 'Print, Save, and Delete', 'b'),
  (8, 'Application Software & OS', 'easy', 'Which popular design app/website lets students easily create posters, certificates, and invitations using ready templates?', 'Device Manager', 'Command Prompt', 'Canva', 'Disk Cleanup', 'c'),
  (8, 'Application Software & OS', 'easy', 'What does "Software" mean in simple everyday language?', 'Soft cloth used to clean a monitor', 'The plastic keyboard keys', 'The power socket on the wall', 'The apps, programs, and operating system that run inside a computer or phone', 'd'),
  (8, 'Application Software & OS', 'easy', 'Which of the following is an Operating System (the core system software that runs a PC or phone)?', 'Windows 11 / Android', 'YouTube', 'Canva', 'WhatsApp', 'a'),
  (8, 'Application Software & OS', 'medium', 'Why do schools send circulars and admit cards as a ".pdf" file instead of an editable Word file?', 'PDFs only open at night', 'PDFs keep the exact layout, fonts, and alignment looking identical on every phone and computer', 'PDFs do not take even 1 byte of space', 'PDFs automatically translate into 50 languages', 'b'),
  (8, 'Application Software & OS', 'medium', 'Which application is best suited for keeping an attendance list, marks table, or club budget with automatic totals?', 'Sound Recorder', 'Photos viewer', 'Microsoft Excel or Google Sheets', 'MS Paint', 'c'),
  (8, 'Application Software & OS', 'medium', 'What is the difference between "Copy & Paste" and "Cut & Paste" on a file?', 'There is no difference', 'Copy works only on photos', 'Cut deletes the file permanently', 'Copy leaves the original file in place and makes a duplicate; Cut moves the file to the new folder', 'd'),
  (8, 'Application Software & OS', 'medium', 'What is a ".zip" file commonly used for when sharing a project?', 'Making music play faster', 'Charging laptop battery faster', 'Changing desktop wallpaper', 'Bundling many files/folders together into one smaller compressed file for easy sending', 'd'),
  (8, 'Application Software & OS', 'medium', 'In Word or Google Docs, what is the difference between "Save" and "Save As"?', '"Save" only works offline', '"Save" updates the current file; "Save As" lets you save a separate copy with a new name or location', '"Save As" deletes the old file', 'Both print the document on paper', 'b'),
  (8, 'Application Software & OS', 'medium', 'Which long bar at the bottom of a Windows screen shows the Start button, pinned apps, and clock?', 'Bookmark bar', 'Scroll bar', 'Taskbar', 'Formula bar', 'c'),
  (8, 'Application Software & OS', 'medium', 'Why do many students turn on "Dark Mode" in apps when reading or working in the evening?', 'It uses a dark background that feels gentler on the eyes in low light', 'It doubles storage space', 'It prints pages in black paper', 'It makes Wi-Fi twice as fast', 'a'),
  (8, 'Application Software & OS', 'hard', 'If you want to jot down a quick plain-text note with zero heavy formatting, which lightweight built-in Windows app opens instantly?', 'Notepad', 'Device Manager', 'Disk Defragmenter', 'Media Player', 'a'),
